-Um...

00:11:22.347 --> 00:11:24.617
-If you don't,
just say you don't.

00:11:24.617 --> 00:11:26.184
-Uh...

00:11:26.184 --> 00:11:27.719
I don't.

00:11:27.719 --> 00:11:28.753
